{"shortDescription":"AI and semiconductor stocks came under heavy selling pressure on Thursday, with the Philadelphia Semiconductor Index NASDAQ:SOX falling about 9.5% as investors reassessed the outlook for data center spending and AI infrastructure following the U.S. midterm elections.Concerns over increased politica…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["AI and semiconductor stocks came under heavy selling pressure on Thursday, with the Philadelphia Semiconductor Index ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:SOX","text":"NASDAQ:SOX"}}," falling about 9.5% as investors reassessed the outlook for data center spending and AI infrastructure following the U.S. midterm elections."]},{"type":"p","children":["Concerns over increased political scrutiny of data center development and infrastructure investments added to pressure on technology stocks, pushing the Nasdaq Composite ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:COMP","text":"NYSE:COMP"}}," down more than 4% and into correction territory."]},{"type":"p","children":["Below is a list of the top 12 semiconductor stocks ranked by their lowest Relative Strength Index ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:RSI","text":"NYSE:RSI"}},", highlighting companies with particularly weak price momentum. Intel Corporation ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:INTC","text":"NASDAQ:INTC"}}," tops the list with an RSI of 23, followed by Cerebras Systems Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:CBRS","text":"NASDAQ:CBRS"}}," at 25 and Marvell Technology, Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:MRVL","text":"NASDAQ:MRVL"}}," at 27. Teradyne, Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:TER","text":"NASDAQ:TER"}}," and ACM Research, Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:ACMR","text":"NASDAQ:ACMR"}}," round out the top five, with RSI readings of 27 and 28, respectively."]},{"type":"p","children":["Lam Research Corporation ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:LRCX","text":"NASDAQ:LRCX"}}," follows with an RSI of 30, while Veeco Instruments Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:VECO","text":"NASDAQ:VECO"}}," has an RSI of 31. Astera Labs, Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:ALAB","text":"NASDAQ:ALAB"}},", Kulicke and Soffa Industries, Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:KLIC","text":"NASDAQ:KLIC"}},", SiTime Corporation ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:SITM","text":"NASDAQ:SITM"}},", Axcelis Technologies, Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:ACLS","text":"NASDAQ:ACLS"}}," and Onto Innovation Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:ONTO","text":"NYSE:ONTO"}}," complete the list, each with an RSI of 32."]},{"type":"p","children":["Several stocks featured have also recorded sharp declines during Thursday's session, including Intel, which fell 8%, Astera Labs, which dropped about 17%, and Veeco Instruments, which declined 7%."]},{"type":"p","children":["Chipmakers bore the brunt of Thursday's technology selloff, with Advanced Micro Devices ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:AMD","text":"NASDAQ:AMD"}}," tumbling about 15%, while Broadcom ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:AVGO","text":"NASDAQ:AVGO"}},", Nvidia ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:NVDA","text":"NASDAQ:NVDA"}}," and Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:TSM","text":"NYSE:TSM"}}," each fell around 7%. AI infrastructure stocks also faced significant pressure, with Sandisk ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:SNDK","text":"NASDAQ:SNDK"}}," dropping 18%, Nebius Group ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:NBIS","text":"NASDAQ:NBIS"}}," and Astera Labs each losing about 17%, and Micron Technology ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:MU","text":"NASDAQ:MU"}}," declining 13%."]},{"type":"p","children":["The weakness extended to chip equipment and component makers, with SiTime falling 11% despite reporting better-than-expected quarterly results, while Veeco Instruments declined 7% after posting a quarterly earnings miss."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Relative Strength Index is a momentum oscillator that measures the velocity and magnitude of price changes, plotting them on a scale from 0 to 100. RSI compares the magnitude of recent gains to recent losses over a chosen lookback period, typically 14 days."]},{"type":"p","children":["Readings below 30 generally suggest that a stock may be oversold, while readings of 70 or above are generally considered a signal that a stock may be overbought and potentially poised for a pullback."]},{"type":"p","children":["Here is the list of the top 12 semiconductor stocks ranked by their lowest RSI:"]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Intel Corporation ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:INTC","text":"NASDAQ:INTC"}},", RSI: 23"]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Cerebras Systems Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:CBRS","text":"NASDAQ:CBRS"}},", RSI: 25"]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Marvell Technology, Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:MRVL","text":"NASDAQ:MRVL"}},", RSI: 27"]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Teradyne, Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:TER","text":"NASDAQ:TER"}},", RSI: 27"]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["ACM Research, Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:ACMR","text":"NASDAQ:ACMR"}},", RSI: 28"]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Lam Research Corporation ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:LRCX","text":"NASDAQ:LRCX"}},", RSI: 30"]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Veeco Instruments Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:VECO","text":"NASDAQ:VECO"}},", RSI: 31"]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Astera Labs, Inc. ",{"